Open ChatGPT's Codex with a model

Usage: wally chatgpt [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -h, --help                  Show help
  -m, --model TEXT            A model on this machine, or a hosted one from your
                              account
      --context-window INT    Tell the app the model holds this many tokens, so
                              it compacts sooner

Examples:
  # The certified local coding model
  wally chatgpt -m qwen3-4b-instruct-2507

  # A hosted model (needs `wally account login`)
  wally chatgpt -m glm-5.3-flash
